    "---\n",
    "## Typeclass Mutation Perturbations\n",
    "\n",
    "The four TC transforms replace one typeclass in a theorem's hypothesis or conclusion with a parent (weaker) or child (stronger) class in the Mathlib hierarchy.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Key | TC position | Direction | Truth effect |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `tc_generalize_hyp` | hypothesis | UP → weaker | true→maybe, false→false |\n",
    "| `tc_weaken_hyp` | hypothesis | DOWN → stronger | true→true, false→maybe |\n",
    "| `tc_strengthen_conc` | conclusion | DOWN → stronger | true→maybe, false→false |\n",
    "| `tc_weaken_conc` | conclusion | UP → weaker | true→true, false→maybe |"
   ]
  },
